; A `{{total}}` reduction whose total no lot has must NOT book (#2325, #2328).
;
; Before #2306 this booked silently against whatever lot the method picked,
; reporting a cost basis the ledger never stated. Python beancount 3.2.3
; rejects it with "No position matches".
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Brokerage
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2026-01-01 open Income:Gain

2026-01-01 * "buy lot one"
  Assets:Brokerage   1 ABC {50.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2026-01-02 * "buy lot two"
  Assets:Brokerage   1 ABC {50.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

; Two lots at 50.00 each cost 100.00 together, not 90.00.
2026-02-01 * "sell both, total written as 90.00"
  Assets:Brokerage  -2 ABC {{90.00 USD}}
  Assets:Cash        120.00 USD
  Income:Gain
